	(text "MJ-1: the 300 A overcurrent latch had NO path to TIM1_BKIN - it\nonly reached the reset chain, so SPEC 9.2 was false as built.\nD904 pulls FAULT_BKIN low when OC_LATCH_N trips: 0.33 mA through\nR909 gives Vf ~0.28 V, so BKIN sits at ~0.31 V vs VIL 0.99 V.\nReverse-biased when only a driver fault is present, so the latch\nis never back-fed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.38 55.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.0 1.0)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9f4f0b54-76e4-43b0-a0ed-7e2f23ea785e")
	)
